# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DOTFILES / AI TOOLS / EDITOR CONFIGS (catch-all)
#    Ignore ALL dotfiles/dotdirs, then explicitly allow what you WANT tracked
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.*
!.gitignore
!.env.sample
!.editorconfig
# Re-include specific subtrees: .github/ is itself a hidden directory
# caught by `.*` above, so re-add it explicitly. Then `workflows/` and
# any files beneath it are picked up by the directory.
!.github/
!.github/workflows/**
# Local-only Claude Code prompt skills used for the polish work.
# These are regenerated on demand and never belong in the repo.
.github/prompts/
#.gitea/ is itself a hidden directory caught by `.*` above, so
#.gitea/ re-add it explicitly. Then `workflows/` and any files
#.gitea/ are picked up by the directory.
!.gitea/
!.gitea/workflows/**
# !.prettierrc
# !.eslintrc.json

